{
  "chapter_id": "12",
  "chapter_name": "租車相關",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "12-001",
      "en": "I have a reservation under the name Johnson.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "reservation",
          "kk": "/ˌrɛzɚˈveʃən/",
          "zh": "預訂"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我有預訂，名字是 Johnson。",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "reservation"
      ],
      "tips": "取車時請出示預訂確認信、護照與信用卡，三者缺一不可。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-002",
      "en": "I'd like to rent a compact car for three days.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "rent",
          "kk": "/rɛnt/",
          "zh": "租"
        },
        {
          "word": "compact",
          "kk": "/ˈkɑmpækt/",
          "zh": "袖珍的"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我想租一輛小型車，租三天。",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "vehicle type"
      ],
      "tips": "Compact car（小型車）省油且容易停車，適合城市旅遊；SUV 則適合需要越野或多行李的旅程。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-003",
      "en": "Does the rental include unlimited mileage?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "unlimited",
          "kk": "/ʌnˈlɪmɪtɪd/",
          "zh": "無限"
        },
        {
          "word": "mileage",
          "kk": "/ˈmaɪlɪdʒ/",
          "zh": "里程"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "租金包含無限里程嗎？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "mileage"
      ],
      "tips": "部分方案限制每日里程數，超過需額外付費，出發前務必確認。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-004",
      "en": "What kind of insurance is included?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "insurance",
          "kk": "/ɪnˈʃʊrəns/",
          "zh": "保險"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "包含哪種保險？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "insurance"
      ],
      "tips": "基本保險通常包含 CDW（碰撞損失豁免），建議加購 TP（竊盜保險）以獲得更完整保障。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-005",
      "en": "Is there an additional driver fee?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "additional",
          "kk": "/əˈdɪʃənl/",
          "zh": "額外的"
        },
        {
          "word": "fee",
          "kk": "/fi/",
          "zh": "費用"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "加掛駕駛人需要額外收費嗎？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "additional driver"
      ],
      "tips": "若旅伴也要開車，必須事先登記為 additional driver，否則出事保險可能無效。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-006",
      "en": "Can I return the car at a different location?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "return",
          "kk": "/rɪˈtɝn/",
          "zh": "返回"
        },
        {
          "word": "location",
          "kk": "/loˈkeʃən/",
          "zh": "地點"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我可以在不同地點還車嗎？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "drop-off"
      ],
      "tips": "異地還車（One-way rental）通常需要額外費用，請提前告知租車公司。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-007",
      "en": "Please explain the fuel policy.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "fuel",
          "kk": "/fjʊəl/",
          "zh": "燃料"
        },
        {
          "word": "policy",
          "kk": "/ˈpɑləsɪ/",
          "zh": "政策"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "請說明燃油政策。",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "fuel"
      ],
      "tips": "最常見的政策是「Full-to-Full」，即取車滿油、還車也要滿油，否則補差額且計管理費。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-008",
      "en": "Does this car have GPS navigation?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "navigation",
          "kk": "/ˌnævɪˈɡeʃən/",
          "zh": "導航"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "這輛車有 GPS 導航嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "GPS"
      ],
      "tips": "租車公司的 GPS 租金較高，建議自備手機支架搭配 Google Maps 或離線地圖，更經濟實惠。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-009",
      "en": "There is a scratch on the bumper. Can you note it down?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "scratch",
          "kk": "/skrætʃ/",
          "zh": "刮痕"
        },
        {
          "word": "bumper",
          "kk": "/ˈbʌmpɚ/",
          "zh": "保險桿"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "保險桿上有一道刮痕，可以幫我記錄下來嗎？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "damage inspection"
      ],
      "tips": "取車時務必與工作人員一同檢查車身，並拍照留存，避免還車時被索賠事先存在的損傷。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-010",
      "en": "I'd like to pay with a credit card.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "credit card",
          "kk": "/ˈkrɛdɪt kɑrd/",
          "zh": "信用卡"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我要用信用卡付款。",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "payment"
      ],
      "tips": "租車通常需要信用卡預授權（hold）一筆金額作為押金，還車後才會解除。金額依車型而異。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-011",
      "en": "What is the speed limit on the highway here?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "speed limit",
          "kk": "/spid ˈlɪmɪt/",
          "zh": "速度極限"
        },
        {
          "word": "highway",
          "kk": "/ˈhaɪˌwe/",
          "zh": "公路"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "這裡高速公路的速限是多少？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "driving rules"
      ],
      "tips": "各國速限不同，美國州際公路通常為 65–75 mph，歐洲高速公路則多為 120–130 km/h。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-012",
      "en": "My car broke down. I need roadside assistance.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "broke down",
          "kk": "/brok daʊn/",
          "zh": "崩潰了"
        },
        {
          "word": "roadside assistance",
          "kk": "/ˈrodsaɪd əˈsɪstəns/",
          "zh": "路邊援助"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我的車拋錨了，我需要道路救援。",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "car rental",
        "emergency"
      ],
      "tips": "租車時會附上道路救援電話，請存入手機備用，並告知正確位置（可參考附近路牌或 GPS 座標）。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    }
  ],
